---
pagination:
  data: agents
  size: 1
  alias: agent
permalink: "/agents/{{ agent.id }}/"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ agent.name }}"
  category: "Agents · {{ agent.name }}"
  lede: "{{ agent.role }}"
layout: page
section: agents
---

<h2 id="who">{{ agent.heading }} <a class="heading-anchor" href="#who" aria-label="Permalink to Who they are">#</a></h2>

{% for paragraph in agent.paragraphs %}
<p>{{ paragraph }}</p>
{% endfor %}

<p class="agent-ask"><strong>Ask about:</strong> {{ agent.consult }}</p>

<h2 id="entry-file">The brain <a class="heading-anchor" href="#entry-file" aria-label="Permalink to The entry file">#</a></h2>

<p>In OpenCode, <code>{{ agent.entry }}</code> is the main agent entry. A generic
runtime that reads <code>AGENTS.md</code> can use the repository directly. The
file is where the voice, guardrails and canon pointers begin.</p>

<p><a href="{{ agent.entryUrl or agent.repo }}">Read {{ agent.entry }} on GitHub</a>.</p>

<p>Series deployment also installs a read-only consult copy,
<code>{{ agent.deployId }}-consult.md</code>, so another agent can ask a question without
getting write access to this one's files.</p>

<h2 id="setup">Eyes up <a class="heading-anchor" href="#setup" aria-label="Permalink to Set it up">#</a></h2>

<pre><code>git clone {{ agent.repo }}.git
cd {{ agent.repoName }}
./setup.sh</code></pre>

<p><code>./setup.sh</code> links or clones the Grimoire, then fetches or builds
the database. Use <code>BOOTSTRAP=1 ./setup.sh</code> for the prebuilt database
without a prompt.</p>

<p>For OpenCode or OpenClaw deployment from the archive, see
<a href="{{ '/agents/install/' | url }}">Deploy the Agents</a>.</p>

<h2 id="checks">The audit <a class="heading-anchor" href="#checks" aria-label="Permalink to Run the checks">#</a></h2>

<pre><code>bash tests/master-audit.sh</code></pre>

<p>The audit checks voice, quotes, module coverage, the conversation path and the
shared structure gates. It is the same suite CI runs.</p>

<h2 id="repository">The source <a class="heading-anchor" href="#repository" aria-label="Permalink to Repository">#</a></h2>

<ul>
  <li><a href="{{ agent.repo }}">{{ agent.repoName }}</a></li>
  <li><a href="{{ agent.repo }}/blob/master/README.md">README</a></li>
  <li><a href="{{ agent.repo }}/issues">Issues</a></li>
</ul>

<h2 id="next">Next <a class="heading-anchor" href="#next" aria-label="Permalink to Next">#</a></h2>

<ul>
  <li><a href="{{ '/agents/' | url }}">Back to the series</a></li>
  {% for other in agents %}{% if other.id != agent.id %}
  <li><a href="{{ ('/agents/' + other.id + '/') | url }}">Meet {{ other.name }}</a></li>
  {% endif %}{% endfor %}
  <li><a href="{{ '/agents/install/' | url }}">Deploy into OpenCode or OpenClaw</a></li>
  <li><a href="{{ '/agents/platforms/' | url }}">Check platform support</a></li>
</ul>
